config BR2_PACKAGE_UNIT_HARNESS
	bool "unit-harness"
	help
	  Unit OS test harness and trace capture for development and
	  test images (work package UNIT-OS-WP-0002). Records input
	  timestamps, injects synthetic input, captures bounded kernel
	  traces and writes result records under Performance procedures
	  PA06 (result record), PA07 (pass logic) and PA08 (efficient
	  instrumentation). Not for release images.
